{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1534,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bef825d0874e0098b61c58e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天这一步，也会是\n创造历史的一步……！\n有一种……这样的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "822654a53b7036d96012ac54d5a3a07d32b8b876c57d175d8a2d1dad78ccaf64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1485459c61c623ad86eff5bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日常的积累……\n总有一天会造就历史。\n今天还请多多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4cac9e33c5a0298f8d93be5dd647a2742831552f225988737d3fc47ccb921f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:612bbecb5a8dc7d7736cf492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今天能努力打起精神……\n我把历史性GⅠ比赛时买的毛巾\n拿来了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81799507bc86a2022e42348f905dbfd6d41bfa46b581dba4439ec76fc7822bd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799ebcb27db679aa27ebdd3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天的奔跑都会有新发现……\n『创世方略』随时更新中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ddbb7409f4ff8ce1488108c307173f954db816d4f787dda97d9cb00837643c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ced9b857cb2c5589424b0aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其他阵营的训练情况\n也得好好注意一下……",
      "source_fingerprint": "580b06dcf7da8d1de6f72093342d8b13dc03967ab3fede987e96a1d4d1945291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1584639d3ca5bac52dff2d0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以6号的实力，本可在那场赛事中\n保持领先.…….——啊！\n对、对不起..……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57f6396c824c85f84661a130971bdd373cd284db4adc6f5404e9bb3042aa10cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:447e3b246197ec343bae9d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了周末就能去赛场……\n到了周末就能去赛场……\n到了周末就能去赛场……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e308127fa4bddbf38c4e10b500a856a5f622ff3d998ceb19c9637eac16b5b2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e5d4846a8ae158b5816e9ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……这个样子……\n还谈什么创造历史……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6772b521c898740a9209621cca048981365a27bb974adbb53a99f1d1342b05e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324d20409dd85ab7733cfd90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能克服这个低谷……\n这段经历，应该……\n也能化作一场戏剧吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e515109bb26ffd9cf0b4d6c016730d5aa17324eea4db94ff1b80cc5e908095b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02126138de5455023bec334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连战……虽然是会有像这样\n需要克服苦难的戏剧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9fc1caea3c2757a4d9e01bf503fdc1d76da33d8f4a8b9b1ad02eed972eaa88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768e9821bc51f6570ddb8e55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样继续参赛……\n这就是……\n训练员的方略吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "533a2e6d8a3e1c8f8436b9cda9f0c2df4def8c671aa2f277c907ce1fe3445f36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0c54aedf94dbc863234199",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳……！即便不说这句话\n……训练员也能对我心知肚明呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b12570d975be78bab745545173f11e7d1d6e635356338852aa0d852f9c257fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f74ca5649fd6e46cd55e37c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要给自己画个记号的话……我选◎！\n……那个，我会带着这样的自信……\n全力应战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be68ed98fe2b0cb53dc436fb2166152d3ee5ceb714f61d6a85c386f8afb3b1f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629d79bf0812313ba53b5dd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了将『梦想』托付给我\n的大家……！我会加油的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec2c2b6a2e06154085ed33d0fd1949814f64158fd160c05e4c79003b8f941646",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935e461e1521518837bc1a50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来会是一场很棒的比赛……！\n『创世方略』里也显示出了\n这样的结果……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "217eb5216597cd8bacb963316e6348faa622bec71eb07f6794c192c061538335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b482a9f094baf03cb0cb371e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天能达成一场载入历史的比赛。\n……我有这种预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c25ec2db39c6f305c6c2490d4dc741e4ae32b2e4961ff7f8991f2f851f28c22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1438daaf1c725977f753dec9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去刻印下来吧……\n刻印下我们的足迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6179e146cb5c210c13c54bd81a32bae7bb2d0f9aee6cff43ef78274cc4155f66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e280f0d5f5ef71075dbd53a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛前调整计时数据良好……\n步态也正常……\n嗯，没问题……",
      "source_fingerprint": "27622c764526481ef59c08634954d9b13d78d46e913e846a4306a148a1faeba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab518597a2259add1f4b64d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为『历史的亲历者』……\n我会不留遗憾地去奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d130784611ab500b4a12924f596506db2a015879aa12824e640b82170393283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ca5efbf3e9a17ce1f0d7b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被『闪耀月刊』刊登，\n我要跑出这样的好成绩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "825015a847e02836bc8a7a78c4d646a0212a5732e2a0e81d61cb625e9f1e6022",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95164a92deb577a2349ad387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到的预测标记是……\n嗯嗯……原来如此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "887ad6bb8faead63ae0cb5ed1f774b7e01f6a11c65299de83148e0b76fbdd581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c1896c0327a3ea155ec9e57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不按照方略行事，\n这也是一种竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a8571d5f131b6a7dab50f99b3313c88df496efba88682ab40047a004189136",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7c7a78abff1521d3f18788",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能否认调整不足……\n但是，将其推翻的话……\n又是一种浪漫……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aaeffe1e081531b745025f9e9fc82b9ccd0ddec015652dd76212f59eb829918",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9448e9d5682a62a9a07cfbb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『赛跑没有绝对』……\n我要积极地向前奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "062614a5e226347ae86a664f005f3910b3902ff08eb31f2cc2ee49f3a3c16e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d956c8246e6bd1997ec4b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为赛跑史的一部分……至少，\n要不辱使命……",
      "source_fingerprint": "586f2a75751e87560f2710d5f73d4c2b017e7ffe93336c4145923ec168976906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb66f4f9c748775c6841a9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝不能……\n用不争气的表现……\n辜负那些托付梦想于我的人们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b6cf093d754a8c6b1ec3e1f2bda60fabeb884440797efb75dff85fb892e624d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aca491fd811bbc0efabbc43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "602dd5bd12b0d5089900226573bb73477f4d5e5b12e24ab6c953ba984b68eee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8517f9e2f658cc66fd7aae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7828e63fb8eabefb40ba846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中精神……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0afc8850f9a4b5d675ad190bef56bc22dc27c35e81c4bf3a04730b9ba3daf47b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7958b707c439c3fe36cc91df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很有意思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c7dd387f6fe605c04939d04387caa5de5446191b14115448acdc1104e6857d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdca7ba026558782fb9f4915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "051f0f01c32f36651f0729cb937301589ae120ebe4a673ae9fba57709afcaa45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e98fecfd59d002f451600bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a58c7a8ef21296edcd18e040e656c0239f29146a83848363a05d8d1a7f069db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5530913e162c1f224df91bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出门呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7da5a6752440bec026dff12b76633d3eedc8afdcf1f89e10e756742a2efcda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0165a37cee73080285ab68df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很美呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4f8f7e558ed3c4b401d8f14d9b87c2c9faea627fad1414fb410e2082c58b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9456daec618a5407c9cd3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是，我们的历史呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c40a09b3d1309b913b8e0b26b98c6dd21ba134877afd62b80b81b1ffa1d9b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47720f7b1ed244ef4e0c4e10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaa51903f19be731baa72434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会记录下来的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761876121a8570b3dbd7d00bf2d717011a0f9162504e074b5da0696cd210b5dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17086157c2c5299f8129afe5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要把这一战，载入历史…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "298ea7fcca7001f3557c17447854d2700625b1ea179e327daae99a269e56bdc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a8160e929d6132afcc8b59a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要把这一战，载入历史…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "298ea7fcca7001f3557c17447854d2700625b1ea179e327daae99a269e56bdc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a4aadc97b5af6afd27af05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5faaa1e8f1377654f6d99c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去刻下……属于我们的足迹吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0010b79ea548b46b59f6b46f5dc6bef4a823ac44aa1005de47cae515d549faf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed6b6765dccecadc46c0d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了认可这份『梦想』\n的各位……！我会努力的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56edcedee1980eaa131aab72c17d548054283e57441550d748646233631c1905",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7924b308470dae7426dc0a3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b170be6932eb234489b3ae1b5349a861e7d50c9c201e2c7e680e1cfe37f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0171f521e486cd2412190f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "602dd5bd12b0d5089900226573bb73477f4d5e5b12e24ab6c953ba984b68eee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c0a0aff6e566a0156f384b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一次，要以胜者之姿\n载入史册……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b04318ac887199e9dc35d17bce333e9f750e39da132c5104e86238502dbce0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a49b728d5fa6f6f7863fbbe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的方略，\n看来得重新审视一下了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a5679e326c73eaacea8e615017a9002dd7367faac0d8683f4677b5e3b2dec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcf54dabb441c3a2a3a10898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才的也只是，\n历史的一部分……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f94582264a2d22f0e6ec16f6ea8a79d5b1380a2e5b570e691119e2abd96ec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7893795aca306422aa9c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也是一种竞赛呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b326808fec26bb5fae8c769528fc0b66890fc087936e37ce2a505ad4ba53dd9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687b57ef80847d72533b151e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是……我的足迹\n所描绘的历史……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "509a622beb6ac1d944795f5beb02734644bbc2f4fb48fb75952ab21679cf8c8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e403691046b8c1f7cebed7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将成为……\n『历史的亲历者』……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b5c9fac647b5354c81a0c1d6460af4485bf43045388393561d9e73bd2398fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac031afe6b1a3c64da64d80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出赛了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb8d8443419c9414f3bfaf57e7f02563575f0bd16f1b33c8e0b0873ce66fe1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66b483408cdb11d06d823ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去创造，属于我的历史……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbe9462aa1606f10e557e7f4ba7b323f600024b2b5a2cd3d988bbdd3540d4fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41603330a21c0ad5f8857f18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无数梦想编织而成的历史——\n从现在开始，由我来创造……\n用我的双脚……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d531c5f91547849fd3eb18afcd81dc61f54b00138c0522e3a94ead4c6e1a63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08ea2cfd538be9c2bae63a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live也要好好使出全力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96aa5e5f00a227fa650ca451f3e6ad8ae96c78fdcdf8ecc8243858dd271d26d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a575503b45b8f1bcb46fb497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请好好看着我奔跑的样子……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22991ba9023c9d1fb2d46cc1d5f4435a32cb22707d719d65410fba69cfd9bdcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c325b9e2129d7e6efeb9c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去书写赛跑史吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4957b5f99b2d72402cb1a8c44e173b05d7f6901a07923e0fb222f4f75b579461",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332487fd40d6c3717377d16b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那天的事也是……如果某一天，\n有人将它写成“历史”的话……\n会用怎样的言语来表达呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52527829eb566d4f855d8d96ed960f4e3303690cfa107f7ea464db2539d431e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4295e44942c7dede725b0a56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是背负着学园历史和传统的装束呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c4e99e7d957908f2e75ab22799cee4f01c91dff045e9835512b76db579d8db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59c0974d5e5b49b0d787f03e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服很上镜呢……\n尤其是跳舞的时候",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9911f2288b558d809b5e97867adf8d194ae8a13b39281495fdf760e2afcacf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1438e9eb9057739ff45c135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很想把穿这身决胜服的姿态\n铭刻在历史上呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d518e22b9756d1511ab9144862ee2dc23dc2a551dc5261d4f3fec5329d8a76e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e877453a99473d138751eb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历代的前辈们也穿过这身制服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2196113f34d0e06930065642419a0f61eaf0542f6fbb3402dd32f073e86cb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf12afaefccc0a6c205c54a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这样被拍摄……总算开始习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2851ece1187648eab33ccc3af854ce3f81d6c223ef4430a5dd7138f8ff503dde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:634aea66cdce9d5be26cc27e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我注重了品格表现..……\n看起来怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13cbc9eabeaff422bbb366eeed6c8684ac6ee21ca22e8eff8d7dcbd26b5c6847",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3483cd56923308c44cd8f13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……衣服换好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39b47fe3d6056d8b4c7f7e0ffbcfb68a4082051f8bb90b4443458746e53f4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea714c217a0e973b02bd1e0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来……合适吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc204ecc0f6ac177c0eda33079801fccb9db342fc3284ff6ede478c7c9c35b7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8a7fb82e1a849e12691ec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去哪里的赛场呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b017e0e897506942abe4ec8d263c4b8bc41cdaae2bb0b36c1ab3b9c9f4ffd25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d16273d21daffd3dc45e9840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿搭我完全不懂呢……\n会不会太朴素了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c22ab5e59b266d0f558d81ed354f3366db2ec6928e80e8c429e5be392f68b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca6315325a06f49af19d7bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是背负着学园历史和传统的装束呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c4e99e7d957908f2e75ab22799cee4f01c91dff045e9835512b76db579d8db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:825b0167b7535f19379fde37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服很上镜呢……\n尤其是跳舞的时候",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9911f2288b558d809b5e97867adf8d194ae8a13b39281495fdf760e2afcacf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e2c56413fc1b35d3639a016",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很想把穿这身决胜服的姿态\n铭刻在历史上呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d518e22b9756d1511ab9144862ee2dc23dc2a551dc5261d4f3fec5329d8a76e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851a62ca63ee9238b22f51b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历代的前辈们也穿过这身制服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2196113f34d0e06930065642419a0f61eaf0542f6fbb3402dd32f073e86cb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876156fe87159df047c424ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这样被拍摄……总算开始习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2851ece1187648eab33ccc3af854ce3f81d6c223ef4430a5dd7138f8ff503dde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2cdd052b32367fac231f08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我注重了品格表现..……\n看起来怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13cbc9eabeaff422bbb366eeed6c8684ac6ee21ca22e8eff8d7dcbd26b5c6847",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bf1fc04b7b201c953d4832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……衣服换好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39b47fe3d6056d8b4c7f7e0ffbcfb68a4082051f8bb90b4443458746e53f4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5533d6bc23dd256704d8898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来……合适吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc204ecc0f6ac177c0eda33079801fccb9db342fc3284ff6ede478c7c9c35b7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78505ac757d5be592d77901a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8496f83d02b1eb1f1379d6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起三分利……\n比如说，可以在赛场上\n和引导马娘合影之类的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4082ca2c50919e0435b83f6940977479ca444f8fd1024a9386edb0aa368e1f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3cc5e47c9e58312851f732d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……啊，没什么……那个，\n今天早上的体育报上\n有一篇很有意思的报道……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b1682cba544f54160cf5765537d723c58e4706ea1b49821d5f7b3a899647a85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c2372f203aac84d3147e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起赛跑，\n考试或许会更好预测……\n毕竟……上午的小测就押中了题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d85d37c3c67244108d73d02053e180726a9756485a6b3d6b0112489a2df1ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9165005586dae898f2a9139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兼顾营养均衡进行微调……\n每周做的几次便当……\n我都会注意这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc1a4841d04e7e99ea0c1afc37ab5a8eef97970e3403b8030465dd11e5344091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "90003"
      ]
    }
  ]
